<title>UK: Hays annual profits jump 20 percent.</title>
<headline>Hays annual profits jump 20 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.3		   vs 18.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.1		    vs 7.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     132.0		  vs 110.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   966.0		  vs 808.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Business services company Hays Plc said there had been an encouraging start to its new financial year across all the group's operations.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 139.0		  vs 116.1</p>
<p> Interest charge	  7.0		    vs 5.8</p>
<p> Tax			  39.5		   vs 32.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  92.5		   vs 77.4</p>
<p> Attributable	     91.1		   vs 75.8</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 29</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 29</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 21</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
